  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "I am Tom. \"This is our house.\" It is a happy house. The door is red. Look! I can see seven windows.",
      "The table is in the kitchen. It has four chairs. We sit there. The wall is white. My bed is in my room. A lamp is next to the bed.",
      "Where is Pip? Pip has a bed too. It is on the floor. He sits on his bed. \"Woof!\" Our garden is small. We love our house. Our family is happy."
    ],
    "summary": "Tom shows us his house. It has a red door, seven windows, a table with four chairs, and a bed for Pip on the floor.",
